   "t": "html",
   "html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-53177\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"424\" height=\"282\">Fall is upon us, bringing with it the beautiful change of colors, cooler temperatures, and a&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">unique set of challenges for industrial vacuum truck operators. As the leaves turn and&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">temperatures drop, it’s not uncommon for vacuum trucks to experience certain operational&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">hitches. But fear not! At Vac2Go, we’ve seen it all and we’re here to guide you through some of </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">the most common issues and their solutions.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><b>Blocked Intake from Falling Leaves</b></h2>\n<p><b><i>The Problem:</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Fall means leaves, and lots of them. They can easily get sucked into the intake,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">causing blockages that hinder the efficiency of your vacuum truck.</span></p>\n<p><b><i>The Solution:</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Regularly inspect and clear the intake areas. Consider using protective mesh or&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">screens to prevent large debris from getting in. For those challenging blockages, Vac2Go offers&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">specialized </span><a href=\"https://vactruckstore.com/?__hstc=221498247.f0ecce42e6ff5bbed243bb3c0544ce52.1786974164980.1786974164980.1786974164980.1&amp;__hssc=221498247.1.1786974164980&amp;__hsfp=a9d4ff04ad3a16f76392ed653a448d3e\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">accessories</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to assist.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><b>Decreased Performance in Cooler Temperatures</b></h2>\n<p><b><i>The Problem</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: As the mercury drops, the fluids and lubricants in your truck can become&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">viscous, leading to reduced performance.</span></p>\n<p><b><i>The Solution:</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Ensure you’re using season-appropriate lubricants. It’s also a good time to&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">consider a full-service check-up. Check out our </span><a href=\"https://vac2go.com/truck-repair/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">maintenance services</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for&nbsp; solutions.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><b><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-53176\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/IMG_1951.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"407\" height=\"305\">Hose and Seal Brittle Breakages</b></h2>\n<p><b><i>The Problem</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: The cold can make rubber hoses and seals brittle, leading to cracks or&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">breakages.</span></p>\n<p><b><i>The Solution:</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Regular inspections are key. Consider replacing old hoses and seals before the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">deep cold sets in. At Vac2Go, we provide </span><a href=\"https://vactruckstore.com/?__hstc=221498247.f0ecce42e6ff5bbed243bb3c0544ce52.1786974164980.1786974164980.1786974164980.1&amp;__hssc=221498247.1.1786974164980&amp;__hsfp=a9d4ff04ad3a16f76392ed653a448d3e\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">high-quality replacement</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> parts that can withstand&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">varying temperatures.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><b>Moisture Build-up leading to Rust</b></h2>\n<p><b><i>The Problem</i></b><b>: </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fall can bring increased rain and moisture. This, combined with the debris&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">collected, can lead to rusting in various parts of the vacuum truck.</span></p>\n<p><b><i>The Solution</i></b><b>:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Ensure thorough cleaning and drying of your vacuum truck post-operation. For&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">added protection, explore our range of high-quality </span><a href=\"https://vactruckstore.com/?__hstc=221498247.f0ecce42e6ff5bbed243bb3c0544ce52.1786974164980.1786974164980.1786974164980.1&amp;__hssc=221498247.1.1786974164980&amp;__hsfp=a9d4ff04ad3a16f76392ed653a448d3e\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">accessories</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><b>Hardened or Clogged Debris</b></h2>\n<p><b><i>The Problem</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Wet fall debris, when left in the truck, can harden or clog, making the next&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">clean-up operation difficult.</span></p>\n<p><b><i>The Solution:</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Always empty the truck promptly after use. For those tough clogs, contact us&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">and let our</span><a href=\"https://vac2go.com/truck-repair/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> skilled team </span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">help determine the problem for you.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Don’t let the challenges of fall slow you down. Ensure your vacuum truck is in top shape to&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">handle the season’s unique demands. Need professional guidance? Our team at </span><a href=\"https://vac2go.com\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vac2Go</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">always ready to assist. From maintenance services to essential accessories, we’ve got you&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">covered. </span><a href=\"https://vac2go.com/contact/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Book an appointment</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> with us today and keep your operations running smoothly all&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">season long!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Remember, the key to a problem-free fall season is regular maintenance and being proactive.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By addressing these common issues head-on, you can ensure efficiency, safety, and longevity&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">for your vacuum truck. Stay safe and happy vacuuming this fall!</span></p>",
